<title>MEXICO: Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday that around 200 head of cattle were exported into the U.S. at one crossing point Monday.</p>
<p>They were sold through Del Rio, Texas. But not enough sales were reported to set trend or quote prices.</p>
<p>&quot;Around 90 percent of supply were previously contracted or sold on video,&quot; USDA said.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
